:: Carter Bedroom Watch TV Ultraman DVD [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 30>>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey! You ever see Ultraman Returns?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> asks as he picks it up from the shelf and shoves it into his DVD player, not even giving you a chance to respond. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Its one of the best Ultraman movies. It’s a little old, but it captures his personality and themes perfectly! Plus, the actor who plays him is super good and actually plays a different hero in one of the recent Superhero shows. It’s kinda funny actually…”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>


<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> goes on a bit of a ramble as the DVD loads up and he presses play. <span style="color:Pink">As it starts, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> sits attentively on his bed, looking up at the screen with a big smile. He than proceeds to quote the entire opening narration before jumping up and posing on his bed as Ultraman’s theme song plays. You can’t help but laugh and clap at the sight, finding his admiration for the hero adorable.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs and blushes as he sits back down, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I just really like this movie. It’s a bit dorky, but it’s just so fun! I like the recent movies and stuff, but this one is just so silly and happy. It’s just… nice.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> shrugs, though you tell him he doesn’t have to defend his love of the movie. <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
    <<link "Scooch closer as the movie starts<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        As the theme song ends and Ultraman’s origin story starts on the screen, <span style="color:Pink">you scooch a bit closer to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> to rest your head on his shoulders. The boy turns to you as you do this, but doesn’t seem to mind as he scooches back. By the time the movie is at the halfway point, you both are practically leaning on each other in a rather cute display. You are about to fall asleep on top of him</span> <span style="color:Yellow">when a fight scene suddenly starts and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> jumps up to his feet in excitement, causing you to fall onto the bed.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },	
                },
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                    },	
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whoops! Sorry.”</span> He apologizes, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“This is just the best scene in the movie, watch!”</span> You smile at the dork as you sit up and watch the admittedly pretty cool fight scene. <br>
        <span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Carter Bedroom]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Dare him to act out the whole movie<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        You ask if he knows the movies by heart and he nods. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course! I’ve watched it a bunch!”</span> You then dare him to prove it by acting out the entire movie as it plays, as a test of his fandom! <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I would, but it’s a little long.”</span> He chuckles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Plus there are some scenes that would be embarrassing to see. Ultraman’s naked when he first lands on earth and is in his underwear when he first learns to fly. Plus, later on in the movie, he gets tied up by the bad guy.”</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },	
                },
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },	
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:Pink">You smile, offering to tie him up naked if it would help him act it out better. This causes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> to turn bright red,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“N- no thanks! We should just watch the movie!”</span> It is pretty cute how flustered he gets from your suggestion and you consider teasing him about it, but are curious enough about those scenes he mentioned so decide to pay attention. <span style="color:LightGreen">The movie does not disappoint.</span> <br>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
